s=\"muy\"><div class=\"muy-head\"><b>អាល់មុខតាសារ ក្នុងការអធិប្បាយគម្ពីរគួរអាន</b><small>អត្ថន័យទូទៅនៃវាក្យខណ្ឌ — មិនមែនជាពាក្យសម្ដីរបស់ស៊ីខទាំងពីរទេ</small></div><p class=\"muy-text\">រីឯអ្នកដែលទង្វើល្អរបស់គេធ្ងន់ជាងទង្វើអាក្រក់នោះ</p><a class=\"muy-credit\" href=\"https://quranenc.com/en/browse/khmer_mokhtasar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Khmer Translation of Al-Mukhtasar in Interpreting the Noble Quran — 2026-11-04 · QuranEnc.com</a></div><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=km#s101a6\">បើកក្នុងតាហ្វសៀរអន្តរកម្ម (អត្ថបទពេញ)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/km/ayah/101-8.html\">វាក្យខណ្ឌបន្ទាប់ (101:8)</a></div></main><nav class=\"langs\" aria-label=\"Language\">🌐 <a href=\"/ayah/101-6.html\" hreflang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" data-l=\"ar\">العربية</a> · <a href=\"/en/ayah/101-6.html\" hreflang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" data-l=\"en\">English</a> · <a href=\"/ur/ayah/101-6.html\" hreflang=\"ur\" lang=\"ur\" data-l=\"ur\">اردو</a> · <a href=\"/id/ayah/101-6.html\" hreflang=\"id\" lang=\"id\" data-l=\"id\">Bahasa Indonesia</a> · <a href=\"/tr/ayah/101-6.html\" hreflang=\"tr\" lang=\"tr\" data-l=\"tr\">Türkçe</a> · <a href=\"/fr/ayah/101-6.html\" hreflang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\" data-l=\"fr\">Français</a> · <a href=\"/bn/ayah/101-6.html\" hreflang=\"bn\" lang=\"bn\" data-l=\"bn\">বাংলা</a> · <a href=\"/ms/ayah/101-6.html\" hreflang=\"ms\" lang=\"ms\" data-l=\"ms\">Bahasa Melayu</a> · <a href=\"/fa/ayah/101-6.html\" hreflang=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" data-l=\"fa\">فارسی</a> · <a href=\"/ru/ayah/101-6.html\" hreflang=\"ru\" lang=\"ru\" data-l=\"ru\">Русский</a> · <a href=\"/sw/ayah/101-6.html\" hreflang=\"sw\" lang=\"sw\" data-l=\"sw\">Kiswahili</a> · <a href=\"/ha/ayah/101-6.html\" hreflang=\"ha\" lang=\"ha\" data-l=\"ha\">Hausa</a> · <a href=\"/es/ayah/101-6.html\" hreflang=\"es\" lang=\"es\" data-l=\"es\">Español</a> · <a href=\"/de/ayah/101-6.html\" hreflang=\"de\" lang=\"de\" data-l=\"de\">Deutsch</a> · <a href=\"/zh/ayah/101-6.html\" hreflang=\